[sliver] The 1.2 mm back wall sets the full-width lifting recess's entry height above the silicone apron. This recess provides under-edge purchase for lifting the seated cover and ends outside the bearing brim. The print pose places the continuous exterior on the bed; physical finish remains unqualified.
alternatives: Filling the recess closes the under-edge purchase against the apron. A taller opening reduces the remaining plate section; increasing the entire plate thickness raises the cover exterior. Retain this local lifting clearance.
