[thin] The front lifting recess leaves a 1.8 mm local cover section above its 1.2 mm opening. Its purpose is finger or nail access under the edge while the plate rests on the apron. This is the specified local cover/access section; the printable pose leaves this solid strip directly on the bed. A production reslice and physical strength/finish remain unqualified.
alternatives: Filling this strip removes the lifting purchase. Thickening the entire cover adds height; a separate handle adds another feature. Retain the broad under-edge recess.
